      "content": [
        "Philemon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "1",
      "sid": "PHM 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Greetings from Paul and Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "PHP 1:1-2",
          "content": [
            "Philippians 1:1–2"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "COL 1:1-2",
          "content": [
            "Colossians 1:1–2"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "PHM 1:1"
        },
        "Paul, a prisoner of Christ Jesus, and Timothy ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " brother,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "To Philemon our beloved fellow worker, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "PHM 1:2"
        },
        "to Apphia our sister, to Archippus our fellow soldier, and to the church ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that meets"
          ]
        },
        " at your",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:2 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "You "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "and "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Your "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "are singular throughout this letter, except in verses 3, 22, and 25."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " house:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "PHM 1:3"
        },
        "Grace and peace to you from God our Father and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Lord Jesus Christ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Philemon’s Faith and Love"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "PHM 1:4"
        },
        "I always thank my God, remembering you in my prayers, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "PHM 1:5"
        },
        "because I hear about your faith in the Lord Jesus and your love for all the saints. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "PHM 1:6"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "I pray"
          ]
        },
        " that your partnership in the faith may become effective as you fully acknowledge every good ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "thing"
          ]
        },
        " that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " ours in Christ. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "PHM 1:7"
        },
        "I take great joy and encouragement in your love, because you, brother, have refreshed the hearts of the saints."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Paul’s Appeal for Onesimus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "PHM 1:8"
        },
        "So ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "although"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ I am bold enough to order you ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to do"
          ]
        },
        " what ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " proper, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "PHM 1:9"
        },
        "I prefer to appeal on the basis of love. ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "For"
          ]
        },
        " I, Paul, am now aged, and a prisoner of Christ Jesus as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "PHM 1:10"
        },
        "I appeal to you for my child Onesimus,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:10 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Onesimus "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "means "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "useful "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "(see verse 11) or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "beneficial "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "(see verse 20)."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " whose father I became ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "while I was"
          ]
        },
        " in chains. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "PHM 1:11"
        },
        "Formerly ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "he was"
          ]
        },
        " useless to you, but now ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "he has become"
          ]
        },
        " useful both to you and to me. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "PHM 1:12"
        },
        "I am sending back to you him who is my very heart."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "PHM 1:13"
        },
        "I would have liked to keep ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "him"
          ]
        },
        " with me, so that on your behalf he could minister to me in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " chains for the gospel. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "PHM 1:14"
        },
        "But I did ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "not"
          ]
        },
        " want to do ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "anything"
          ]
        },
        " without your consent, so that your goodness will not be out of compulsion, but by your own free will. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "PHM 1:15"
        },
        "For perhaps this is why he was separated ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "from you"
          ]
        },
        " for a while, so that you might have him back for good — ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "PHM 1:16"
        },
        "no longer as a slave, but better than a slave, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as"
          ]
        },
        " a beloved brother. ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "He is"
          ]
        },
        " especially ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "beloved "
          ]
        },
        " to me, but even more so to you, both in person and in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Lord."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "PHM 1:17"
        },
        "So if you consider me a partner, receive him as ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "you would receive"
          ]
        },
        " me. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "PHM 1:18"
        },
        "But if he has wronged you in any way or owes ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "you anything"
          ]
        },
        ", charge it to my account. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "PHM 1:19"
        },
        "I, Paul, write ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this"
          ]
        },
        " with my own hand. I will repay ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it"
          ]
        },
        "— not to mention that you owe me your very self."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "PHM 1:20"
        },
        "Yes, brother, let me have some benefit",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:20 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Greek "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "onaimēn"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                ", a play on the name "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Onesimus"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " from you in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Lord. Refresh my heart in Christ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "PHM 1:21"
        },
        "Confident of your obedience, I write to you, knowing that you will do even more than I ask."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "PHM 1:22"
        },
        "In the meantime, prepare a guest room for me, because I hope that through your prayers I will be restored to you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Additional Greetings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "23",
          "sid": "PHM 1:23"
        },
        "Epaphras, my fellow prisoner in Christ Jesus, sends you greetings, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "24",
          "sid": "PHM 1:24"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as do"
          ]
        },
        " Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " Luke, my fellow workers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "25",
          "sid": "PHM 1:25"
        },
        "The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " with your spirit.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:25 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Amen."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}